ook and it  was way before YouTube is a way before  it was so easy to make and distribute  music and share your work online you  know so it was a challenging time and  really dark but I decided to direct the  video myself it was for a song called  the kill they released it and it changed  our lives so you know and that's that  story has kind of happened more than a  few times in our careers you know and  it's happened to me as an actor it's  happened to me as a director I've looked  at things so many times videos that you  guys see now and think oh that's pretty  good and just wanted to like rip my  eyeballs out it was so bad so I think  the thing that we don't teach each other  and remind each other enough of is that  failure is often times more important  than success and success is the thing  that can actually make us fail it's  really important to note what the  lessons are to learn in failure and it  happens a lot it doesn't feel good but  it's a necessity how many times have you  guys you know NSU in a situation of need  a moment of need you know you know what  I need I need  right and you blow it off and in three  years later there's a guy you know on an  infomercial describing exactly your idea  and he's showing you how great your  product works you have to be unafraid to  listen and unafraid to think that's  something that you have is a good idea  now you also can't believe in it so much  that you that you have deaf ears toward  like reason and reality because you can  have the most brilliant idea in the  world but you gotta bet on yourself you  can't think that like that one idea and  the way that you think is supposed to  happen is the only way that it can  happen you know don't wait for the stars  to when I reach up and rearrange them  the way you want create your own  constellation I say that all the time  you just have to be smart enough to know  that like you know there's so many ways  that like things can turn out you know  and there's so many people in their  lives that man if I would have just made  that left turn if I would have just  stayed in the house five more minutes or  whatever like what I could have shoulda  if we would bet on ourselves but at the  same time taking consideration what this  moment will mean to us ten years from  now it could be different but listen I  haven't made all the best decisions in  the world either I definitely fell on my  ass a million times but I learned on my  way down and I definitely take it in  stride getting back up thank you guys so  much for watching I hope you enjoyed I'd  love to know what you think of this new  series did you like it she would  continue it is there another group that  you want us to profile set of musicians  let me know should we kill the series  was it not valuable to you let me know  leaving the comments put your thoughts  down there I'm going to join in the  discussion I also want to give a quick  shout out to Danielle Valenzuela from  Dee Valenzuela comm Daniel thank you so  much for buying my book it really means  a lot to me those you're watching if you  want to change that a shadow in the  future video make sure to pick up a copy  of the book it's really good I promise  and also emailing the receipt so that we  can keep track and send you the free  bonuses thank you guys so much for  watching have an amazing day continue to  believe or whatever your one word is and  I'll see you soon
 

